   "description": "<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://instructure-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/account_73010000000000001/attachments/24286017/dp_app.css\"><div id=\"dp-wrapper\" class=\"dp-wrapper dp-rounded-corners\" data-header-class=\"dp-header dp-rounded-corners\" data-nav-class=\"container-fluid dp-link-grid dp-rounded-corners dp-rc-1\" data-img-class=\"rounded-3\" data-img-url=\"https://designtools.ciditools.com/css/images/banner_desert_sky.png\"><header class=\"dp-header dp-rounded-corners\">\n<h2 class=\"dp-heading\"><span class=\"dp-header-pre\"><span class=\"dp-header-pre-1\">Week 5 -</span> <span class=\"dp-header-pre-2\">Class 8</span> </span> <span class=\"dp-header-title\">CLASSWORK</span></h2>\n<p class=\"dp-header-subtitle\">Molar Mass</p>\n</header>\n<div class=\"dp-content-block\">\n<div class=\"dp-content-block\">\n<h3 class=\"dp-has-icon\">Directions</h3>\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\">\n<li>Refer to the following problems.</li>\n<li>Complete each problem and show your work. <em>Make sure that your work is clear, organized, and easy to read/understand.</em></li>\n<li>Submit a screenshot of your work.&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n<p><a class=\"instructure_file_link instructure_scribd_file auto_open\" title=\"Link\" href=\"https://instructure.charlotte.edu/courses/272622/files/34198372?verifier=b753f05a-6a1a-4e2d-af56-e8382d1a916f&amp;wrap=1\" target=\"_blank\" data-canvas-previewable=\"true\" data-api-endpoint=\"https://instructure.charlotte.edu/api/v1/courses/272622/files/34198372\" data-api-returntype=\"File\">Class 8 - Worksheet - Molar Mass.pdf</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dp-content-block\">\n<h3 class=\"dp-has-icon\">Grading Criteria</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>This problem set is graded for <em><strong>completion </strong></em>(complete/incomplete).</li>\n<li>Problem set solutions will be available for review after the due date.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"dp-content-block\">\n<h3 class=\"dp-has-icon\">How to Submit</h3>\n<p>Use the directions below to submit your assignment</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span>To submit an assignment, click the&nbsp;</span><strong>Start Assignment</strong><span>&nbsp;button.</span></li>\n<li>To submit a file, select the<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>Upload File</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>tab. Select your file to upload.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Click the<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>Submit Assignment</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>button.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><script src=\"https://instructure-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com/account_73010000000000001/attachments/24286016/dp_app.js\"></script>",
